    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b1f1eb91_878b9da7",
        "filename": "core/java/android/app/BroadcastOptions.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 274,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-15T10:20:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can\u0027t do the same thing with setRequireCompatChange* though. The point of these methods is to not send to apps that declare the receiver in their manifest, but send it to apps that register dynamically. This was done for performance purposes, to avoid spinning up apps with broadcasts like CONNECTIVITY_ACTION which can be frequent.\n\nI think there is still a use case for this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 274,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 274,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "83f993d26b4f67b113eb8abb478812bb9d88067e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8bdfc346_85b17427",
        "filename": "core/java/android/app/BroadcastOptions.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 274,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006166
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-21T22:37:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we had to deploy that feature today, I think we\u0027d build it as follows:\n\n* Define a new change ID named something like MY_CHANGE_ID which was @EnabledAfter a particular SDK level\n* Send CONNECTIVITY_ACTION with Intent.FLAG_RECEIVER_REGISTERED_ONLY and setRequireCompatChangeEnabled(MY_CHANGE_ID), which would be the \"modern\" behavior of only sending to registered filters\n* Send plain CONNECTIVITY_ACTION with setRequireCompatChangeDisabled(MY_CHANGE_ID), which will give the \"legacy\" behavior of sending to both manifest and registered receivers\n\nSo I think we do have all the tools we need?",
      "parentUuid": "b1f1eb91_878b9da7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 274,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 274,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "83f993d26b4f67b113eb8abb478812bb9d88067e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
