      "message": "I was thinking about this limitation while looking at the API ; I was thinking we may have cases where we need Or(change1, change2) or And(change1, change2).\n\nMaybe YAGNI, and we add it if a use case arises",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 375,
        "startChar": 0,
